# Build-time API URL for the React app.
# - Leave empty (default) when the storefront and API share a host: the app
#   calls the same-origin "/api/v1" and your reverse proxy forwards /api.
#     Dev example: this is what the Vite dev proxy handles automatically.
# - Set to an absolute URL when the frontend is hosted separately from the API.
#     Example:  VITE_API_URL=https://api.betamodehus.com/api/v1
# This is a build-time variable: after changing it, restart `npm run dev` or
# rebuild with `npm run build`.
# VITE_API_URL=